rem |||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||
rem |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
rem |                          Project Reality Map List                             |
rem |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
rem |    16/32/64 does not represent player size, instead, different map layouts    |
rem |         128 layers are recommended to be used with 100 player servers         |
rem |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
rem |  16 = Infantry Layer     At most light transport vehicles only                |
rem |  32 = Alternative Layer  An alternative layout with different vehicles/flags  |
rem |  64 = Standard Layer     The normal map layout                                |
rem | 128 = Large Layer        Copy of 64 with higher ticket count for longer rounds|
rem |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
rem |||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||

rem mapList.append <mapname> <gamemode> <layer>

rem |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
rem |   Advance and Secure. Capture and defend control points (Default GameMode)    |
rem |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|

mapList.append donbas gpm_cq 64
